=2 Walkthrough
* Travel to {z:Mine Shaft #2716|Mine Shaft 2716} and check the **Shaft Entrance** for a cutscene.
** There are several ways to reach this zone:
*** Use the Home Point ({z:Newton Movalpolos} #1) - You should have this from when you came here for Promathia Mission 5-3.
*** Trade a {i:Snow Lily|Snow Lily|1725} to {n:Tarnotik} at (K-10) in {z:Oldton Movalpolos} and he will warp you there.
*** Gamble with {n:Twinkbrix} at (E-13) in {z:Oldton Movalpolos} until you win the {@k} {p:Shaft 2716 operating lever}, then pay him 2000 more gil to warp you there.
*** The old fashioned (super-long) way of walking through {z:Newton Movalpolos} and operating the furnace hatches.
**** This requires at least 3 people.
* Head to the {z:Metalworks} and speak with {p:Cid}.

\***Wait for a new Vana'diel day** and speak with {p:Cid} again to begin the next mission.
=2 Notes
* This was the last mission in the second CoP mission update.
* While Cid is repairing the airship, finishing {M:Rise of the Zilart Missions|Rise of the Zilart Missions|Rise of the Zilart Missions} is recommended to help understand the last chapters of this story.

